:''Worker Cat Efficiency increased!''
The '''Energy Drink''' is the first [[Empire of Cats]] [[Treasure]], and therefore the first Treasure the player can activate. It increases the rate at which the player earns money during battle.

==Effect==
Increases money income rate by a maximum of +100%. Unlike the Worker Cat Efficiency upgrade, the Energy Drink does not increase the [[Worker Cat]]'s upgrade cost.

When the player has activated Energy Drink at 100% in all three chapters, money income rate is increased by 300%.

